# Beyond.js Folder Structure Guide

## Core Principles

This rule defines the architectural organization principles for beyond.js projects, focusing on **separation of
concerns** and **layer-based architecture** rather than specific module names.

## Project Structure

### @modules/

Contains application-specific modules and pages. This is where you place your main application logic, pages, and
business modules.

### src/

Contains the Pragmate UI library components and utilities. This is the main library code that provides reusable UI
components.

### docs/

Contains the documentation package for the project. This includes documentation, examples, and demo pages.
